<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-19T11:00:49.170Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:00:49 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard, now led by new commandant Rommel Supangan, conducted an anti-piracy drill with Japan in Manila Bay while the United States and the Philippines held their 16th bilateral maritime exercise in the West Philippine Sea. Chinese coast guard vessels entered restricted waters near the Pratas Islands and Chinese navy ships operated near Scarborough Shoal, prompting a Philippine lawmaker to call for a review of water-cannon use against Chinese vessels and an envoy to warn that China could easily win a conflict. The PCG rescued four people, including a child, on Hagonoy Island in Surigao del Sur. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQZWF3dm9yRFBJNE4xRE5mT0xXT2gyNjRYUENtSHZkS1ppYVNpOGhGNzh6Q2xWT0JPSFpKRjVHdXgxc25Rd0hRSXk1LW5XdmlzdTFQMXQwVkpDZHFXZXRWSlFBUkx2RnNCTktvbEktX0JNeXdsT1l6QzRveGNBQ21rc3ZPM1l0cXE5dlc1NVQ1cExFdzUyd2l4MDRMdk5zWi0wSmdNYkRrRWZzWjg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOc3FaYjBYTmVBQW92UE1KRF9pRUNjX2wybVktN1RVY25Ka2Y4RTF4STRwUkdmbGJheTBLRkpMUkl0dzZ1Qk9vd1JNaGRPR0JUQ0NXemtnZGQ0Z0JwUTdSMkg2NlJPWjJ2TXdJamtwOF94NFB1TVhIeG9PamI0eWx3SkV5azZIVlJoSkRKUEtZQ05Cem1SX29PWTkwOFlMeHNj?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sri Lanka Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaleej Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxQWW1Cam55R3UwTWE4LXYzLWQ1ek1IOWE3T2ZoMFBSSHF5ZExuVHd0aHdlVlY5RmVLSWNHa1ZZUktNUzBVRDBFOU9Wc0duX3F4ZG84cnFCb0hUUlhScTFHckhWcHRHN1NGSGZ3azBuWHVycjk4aXVMSnpkYUxZTWc4MkxjbTlUS2lxNktmaFBZeGxpRWJ4Z0RsUThneW4?oc=5